config GPIO_ROCKCHIP
	bool "Rockchip GPIO bank driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ROCKCHIP_GPIO_BANK_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the common Rockchip GPIO bank driver. The driver supports
	  the legacy and split-register GPIO layouts, interrupts, and basic
	  input/output operations. SoC-specific bank quirks are selected
	  through devicetree properties. The split-register layout is
	  currently validated on RK3506.
